<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Bayzicks — Digital work, explained from the start</title>
<meta name="description" content="Bayzicks explains remote work, digital marketing, and tech in plain language for complete beginners and non-technical people who've bought courses but still don't have a clear path. Free coaching, a free 30-minute consultation, a free community, plus templates and tools to get started.">
<meta property="og:title" content="Bayzicks — Digital work, explained from the start">
<meta property="og:description" content="Remote work, digital marketing, and tech — broken down in plain language for beginners. Free coaching, free consultations, a free community, and practical templates to get you moving.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Karla:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --forest: #16302B;
    --forest-deep: #0F221E;
    --parchment: #F0E6D2;
    --parchment-dim: #E7DBC0;
    --amber: #E8A33D;
    --amber-deep: #C97F1F;
    --sage: #7FA98F;
    --ink: #22201B;
    --ink-soft: #4A463D;
    color-scheme: light;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px);
    padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px);
  }
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: inherit; }
  html { scroll-padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px); scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--parchment);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'Karla', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.6;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif; margin: 0; color: var(--forest); letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  p { margin: 0; }
  a { color: inherit; }
  img, svg { max-width: 100%; }
  .wrap { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 28px; }
  .wide-wrap { max-width: 1040px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 28px; }

  /* Trail line running through the page */
  .trail {
    position: relative;
  }
  .trail::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 2px;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--amber) 0 8px, transparent 8px 16px);
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    opacity: 0.55;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .trail::before { left: 24px; }
  }

  .waypoint {
    position: relative;
    padding: 88px 0 24px;
  }
  .waypoint-marker {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 88px;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--parchment);
    border: 2px solid var(--amber);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--amber-deep);
    font-weight: 600;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .waypoint-marker { left: 24px; }
  }

  /* HERO */
  .hero {
    background: var(--forest);
    color: var(--parchment);
    padding: 84px 28px 96px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-inner {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Karla', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--sage);
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .hero h1 {
    color: var(--parchment);
    font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 5.2vw, 3.6rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.12;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .hero p.sub {
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
    color: #D9CFB4;
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto 40px;
  }
  .cta-row { display: flex; gap: 16px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .hero-image {
    max-width: 880px;
    margin: 56px auto 0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(240,230,210,0.18);
  }
  .hero-image img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 15px 30px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    border: none;
    font-family: 'Karla', sans-serif;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }
  .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .btn:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--sage); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--amber); color: var(--forest-deep); }
  .btn-primary:hover { box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(232,163,61,0.35); }
  .btn-ghost { background: transparent; color: var(--parchment); border: 1.5px solid rgba(240,230,210,0.4); }
  .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--parchment); }

  .hero-path-svg {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -2px; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 60px;
  }

  /* PROBLEM */
  .section-light { background: var(--parchment); padding-bottom: 30px; }
  .waypoint-label {
    font-family: 'Karla', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--amber-deep);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    display: block;
  }
  .problem h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.4vw, 2.1rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.4;
    max-width: 600px;
  }
  .problem .punch {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--forest);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  }

  /* METHOD */
  .method { background: var(--parchment-dim); }
  .method-inner { max-width: 640px; }
  .method h2 { font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3.6vw, 2.3rem); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .method p { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 1.08rem; }
  .method p + p { margin-top: 14px; }

  /* OFFERS */
  .offers { background: var(--forest); color: var(--parchment); }
  .offers .waypoint-label { color: var(--amber); }
  .offers h2 { color: var(--parchment); font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3.6vw, 2.3rem); font-weight: 600; max-width: 500px; margin-bottom: 44px; }
  .offer-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 22px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .offer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .offer-card {
    background: var(--forest-deep);
    border: 1px solid rgba(127,169,143,0.3);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 30px 26px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .offer-card h3 { color: var(--parchment); font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .free-tag {
    font-family: 'Karla', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--forest-deep);
    background: var(--sage);
    padding: 3px 9px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .offer-card p { color: #C9BFA4; font-size: 0.98rem; flex-grow: 1; }
  .offer-card a.link {
    color: var(--amber);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
  }
  .offer-card a.link:hover { border-bottom-color: var(--amber); }

  /* EMAIL CAPTURE */
  .email-section { background: var(--sage); color: var(--forest-deep); }
  .email-inner { max-width: 560px; text-align: center; }
  .email-section h2 { color: var(--forest-deep); font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .email-section p.lead { color: var(--forest-deep); opacity: 0.85; margin-bottom: 28px; }
  form.signup {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  input[type="email"] {
    flex: 1 1 260px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--forest-deep);
    font-family: 'Karla', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    background: var(--parchment);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  input[type="email"]:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--forest-deep); outline-offset: 1px; }
  .signup .btn-primary { background: var(--forest-deep); color: var(--parchment); flex: 0 0 auto; }
  .form-note { margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.85rem; opacity: 0.75; }
  .form-success { margin-top: 16px; font-weight: 600; display: none; }
  .form-success.show { display: block; }

  /* TESTIMONIALS */
  .proof { background: var(--parchment); }
  .proof h2 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 36px; text-align: center; }
  .proof-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
  @media (max-width: 780px) { .proof-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .proof-card {
    background: var(--parchment-dim);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 26px;
  }
  .proof-card p.quote { font-style: italic; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 0.98rem; }
  .proof-card p.who { font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--forest); }
  .proof-card p.role { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }

  /* FAQ */
  .faq { background: var(--parchment-dim); }
  .faq h2 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .faq-item { border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(34,32,27,0.15); }
  .faq-item summary {
    padding: 20px 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--forest);
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .faq-item summary .plus { font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--amber-deep); transition: transform 0.2s ease; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .faq-item[open] summary .plus { transform: rotate(45deg); }
  .faq-item p { padding-bottom: 20px; color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 600px; }

  /* FINAL CTA */
  .final { background: var(--forest); color: var(--parchment); text-align: center; padding: 90px 28px 60px; }
  .final h2 { color: var(--parchment); font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.8vw, 2.5rem); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .final p { color: #D9CFB4; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto 36px; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  footer {
    background: var(--forest-deep);
    color: #9FB3A9;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 30px 28px;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
  }
  footer .brand { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; color: var(--parchment); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px; display: block; font-size: 1.1rem; }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
    .btn:hover { transform: none; }
  }

  /* NAV */
  nav.site-nav {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 50;
    background: var(--forest-deep);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(240,230,210,0.12);
    padding: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px) 0 0;
  }
  .nav-inner {
    max-width: 1040px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .nav-logo {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    color: var(--parchment);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .nav-links a {
    color: #C9BFA4;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--amber); }
  .nav-cta {
    background: var(--amber);
    color: var(--forest-deep);
    padding: 9px 18px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .nav-links a.hide-mobile { display: none; }
  }

  /* CONTACT / COLLAB */
  .contact-section { background: var(--parchment); }
  .contact-section h2 { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.2vw, 2.1rem); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .contact-section .lead { color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 520px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .tabs { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .tab-btn {
    font-family: 'Karla', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.95rem;
    padding: 11px 20px; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer;
    background: transparent; color: var(--forest); border: 1.5px solid var(--forest);
  }
  .tab-btn[aria-selected="true"] { background: var(--forest); color: var(--parchment); }
  .tab-btn:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--amber); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .tab-panel[hidden] { display: none; }
  .collab-types { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin: 0 0 26px; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .collab-types { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .collab-types li { background: var(--parchment-dim); border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 16px; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .collab-types strong { display: block; color: var(--forest); font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .field { margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .field label { display: block; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--forest); margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .field input, .field select, .field textarea {
    width: 100%; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1.5px solid rgba(22,48,43,0.35);
    font-family: 'Karla', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; background: #FBF6EA; color: var(--ink);
  }
  .field textarea { min-height: 120px; resize: vertical; }
  .field input:focus-visible, .field select:focus-visible, .field textarea:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--amber); outline-offset: 1px; }
  .contact-note { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink-soft); display: none; }
  .contact-note.show { display: block; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <nav class="site-nav">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a href="#" class="nav-logo">Bayzicks</a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#offers" class="hide-mobile">Offers</a>
        <a href="#email" class="hide-mobile">Free guide</a>
        <a href="#contact" class="hide-mobile" data-tab="contact">Contact</a>
        <a href="#contact" class="hide-mobile" data-tab="collab">Collaborate</a>
        <a href="#offers" class="nav-cta">Get started</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <span class="hero-eyebrow">BAYZICKS</span>
      <h1>You're not behind.<br>You just never had a map.</h1>
      <p class="sub">We take the confusing world of remote work, digital marketing, and tech — and explain it like a friend who's already done it would.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a href="#offers" class="btn btn-primary">Let's find your path</a>
        <a href="#email" class="btn btn-ghost">Get the free career guide</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-image">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="A messy pile of digital-world jargon and screenshots (CRM, API, SaaS, freelancing, side hustle) funneling through Bayzicks into five clear categories: Roles, Skills, Tools, Learning Path, and Job Opportunities.">
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="trail">

    <!-- PROBLEM -->
    <section class="section-light waypoint problem">
      <span class="waypoint-marker">1</span>
      <div class="wrap">
        <span class="waypoint-label">The problem</span>
        <h2>You've bought the courses. Watched the videos. Bookmarked the threads.</h2>
        <p class="punch">And somehow, you still don't know what to actually do first. That's not a "you" problem — it's a "nobody explained the basics" problem.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:16px; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:1.05rem;">If that's you — yes, this is for you. Bayzicks exists for exactly this moment.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- METHOD -->
    <section class="method waypoint">
      <span class="waypoint-marker">2</span>
      <div class="wrap method-inner">
        <span class="waypoint-label">The Bayzicks method</span>
        <h2>We start where the jargon usually starts — and stop there until it makes sense.</h2>
        <p>Every "how to get into digital work" resource assumes you already speak the language. We don't. We break remote work, digital marketing, and tech down to the plain, un-scary version first — the same starting point we'd want if we were beginners again — then build up from there, one real step at a time.</p>
        <p>No fifth course. No sixty-tab rabbit hole. Just a clear next move, explained by someone who remembers what it felt like to be a total beginner with no structured path.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- OFFERS -->
    <section class="offers waypoint" id="offers">
      <span class="waypoint-marker">3</span>
      <div class="wide-wrap">
        <span class="waypoint-label">Pick your way in</span>
        <h2>However you learn best, there's a door in.</h2>
        <p style="color:#C9BFA4; max-width:480px; margin-bottom:32px; font-size:1rem;">Coaching, consultations, and the community are free. The recommended tool below is the one thing we currently earn from.</p>
        <div class="offer-grid">
          <div class="offer-card">
            <h3>Coaching <span class="free-tag">Free</span></h3>
            <p>Ongoing guidance to build your path and actually stick to it, with someone checking in on your progress — at no cost.</p>
            <a href="#" class="link">Book a free session →</a>
          </div>
          <div class="offer-card">
            <h3>Recommended tool</h3>
            <p>A tool we personally recommend for niching down and turning what you know into something you can sell. <span style="opacity:0.7; font-size:0.85rem;">(Affiliate link — we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.)</span></p>
            <a href="https://monetize.adeifeadeoye.com/?ref=SHERRY902" class="link">See the tool →</a>
          </div>
          <div class="offer-card">
            <h3>1:1 consultation <span class="free-tag">Free</span></h3>
            <p>A focused, free 30-minute session to untangle exactly where you're stuck and map out what's next.</p>
            <a href="#" class="link">Book your free 30 min →</a>
          </div>
          <div class="offer-card">
            <h3>Community <span class="free-tag">Free</span></h3>
            <p>A place to ask the "basic" questions without judgment, alongside people on the same path. Hosted on Nestuge.</p>
            <a href="#" class="link">Join on Nestuge →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="margin-top:22px; color:#9FB3A9; font-size:0.9rem;">Our own templates and tools are in the works — coming soon.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- EMAIL / BROCHURE -->
    <section class="email-section waypoint" id="email">
      <span class="waypoint-marker">4</span>
      <div class="wrap email-inner">
        <span class="waypoint-label">Free download</span>
        <h2>The Digital Careers Field Guide — every path, plainly explained.</h2>
        <p class="lead">Freelancing, service-based work, cybersecurity, tech sales, deal closing, marketing, and more — one free brochure covering the roles out there and the skills each one actually needs. Get it free, straight to your inbox.</p>
        <form class="signup" id="signupForm">
          <input type="email" required placeholder="you@email.com" aria-label="Email address" id="emailInput">
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Send me the guide</button>
        </form>
        <p class="form-success" id="formSuccess">Here's your guide — check your downloads.</p>
        <p class="form-note">Submitting downloads the real guide right now. Emails aren't being saved to a list yet — connect an email tool (Mailchimp, ConvertKit, etc.) to start building one.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FOUNDER NOTE -->
    <section class="proof waypoint">
      <span class="waypoint-marker">5</span>
      <div class="wrap">
        <span class="waypoint-label">A quick note</span>
        <h2 style="font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.8vw, 1.9rem); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 560px;">Bayzicks is just getting started — which means you'd be one of the first people through the door.</h2>
        <p style="margin-top: 18px; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 1.05rem; max-width: 540px;">That's not a downside. It means more direct access to coaching and consultations while spots are open, and a real say in what the free guide and community end up covering. Once there are stories to share here, we will — for now, the offer stands on its own.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <section class="faq waypoint">
      <span class="waypoint-marker">6</span>
      <div class="wrap">
        <span class="waypoint-label">Before you go</span>
        <h2>Questions people usually have</h2>

        <details class="faq-item" open>
          <summary>I've already bought so many courses. Why would this be different?<span class="plus">+</span></summary>
          <p>Most courses teach a skill assuming you already know how the pieces fit together. We start one step earlier — with the map — so the skill actually has somewhere to go.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>I don't know if I want coaching, a consultation, templates, or the community. What do I pick?<span class="plus">+</span></summary>
          <p>Start with whichever fits how you learn: a free 30-minute consultation if you just need a quick gut-check, coaching if you want ongoing accountability, templates if you want to move fast on your own, or the community on Nestuge if you want to think out loud with others first.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Is this only for people who want to work in tech?<span class="plus">+</span></summary>
          <p>No. It's for anyone trying to understand remote work, digital marketing, or the tech world well enough to move confidently — whether that's a job, a side project, or just making sense of it.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>What if I'm truly starting from zero?<span class="plus">+</span></summary>
          <p>That's exactly who this is built for. Zero is the starting point we design from, not the exception.</p>
        </details>
